{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27631","headline":"题灵隐寺师一上人十韵 · 张祜","name":"题灵隐寺师一上人十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八十空门子，深山土木骸。\n片衣闲自衲，单食老长斋。\n道性终能遣，人情少不乖。\n樔枸居上院，薜荔俯层阶。\n洗鉢前临水，窥门外有柴。\n朗吟挥竹拂，高楫曳芒鞋。\n迸笋斜穿坞，飞泉下喷崖。\n种花忻土润，拨石虑沙埋。\n旧往师招隐，初临我咏怀。\n何当缘兴翫，更爲表新牌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27631.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27631","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}